## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical, cross-region DR readiness, covering data-plane replication (S3, DynamoDB, RDS), control-plane orchestration (Route 53, Step Functions), and verification. It also tests how the candidate balances RPO/RTO constraints with cost and complexity, plus DR drills.

## Key Concepts
- RDS cross-region read replicas and promotion
- DynamoDB Global Tables
- S3 cross-region replication
- Route 53 health checks and failover routing
- Step Functions orchestration and idempotent deployments
- DR testing and rollback planning

